{"product_id":"the-universe-versus-alex-woods","title":"The Universe Versus Alex Woods","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eA rare meteorite struck Alex Woods when he was ten years old, leaving scars and marking him for an extraordinary future. The son of a fortune teller, bookish, and an easy target for bullies, Alex hasn't had the easiest childhood.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBut when he meets curmudgeonly widower Mr. Peterson, he finds an unlikely friend. Someone who teaches him that you only get one shot at life. That you have to make it count.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSo when, aged seventeen, Alex is stopped at customs with 113 grams of marijuana, an urn full of ashes on the front seat, and an entire nation in uproar, he's fairly sure he's done the right thing ...\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003eIntroducing a bright young voice destined to charm the world,\u003c\/span\u003e\u003ci\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eThe Universe Versus Alex Woods\u003c\/i\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is a celebration of curious incidents, astronomy and astrology, the works of Kurt Vonnegut and the unexpected connections that form our world.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDimensions:125 x 195 \u003cbr\u003eAuthor: Gavin Extence \u003cbr\u003eISBN: 9781444765892 \u003cbr\u003eFormat: Hardcover \u003cbr\u003ePages\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43656325267609,"sku":"15RE-3-9781444765892","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/84c4c2d0d711ef788f679d45bd961eb2.jpg?v=1719072823","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-universe-versus-alex-woods","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}